    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. i'll look into aeration. i was also wondering about the soil itself—is it possible for the nutrients to just be \"gone\" or used up by something else? like if there are pests or organisms in the dirt that are eating the nutrients before the grass can get to them?",
